41d-13c5-4908-8b29-344b57f7af88.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1582319/bc0d141d-13c5-4908-8b29-344b57f7af88.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1582319/bc0d141d-13c5-4908-8b29-344b57f7af88.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"My beautiful ground floor flat for up to 3 people has everything you need for a great stay: \n→ King-size bed \n→ Smart TV with NETFLIX\n→ Free parking space \n→ Coffee machine \n→ Fully equipped kitchen \n→ Washing machine \n→ Public transport connection to Koblenz with the train station within walking distance \n→ Bendorf hospital just around the corner \n\n☆\"Everything very new, modern and tastefully furnished. Perfect for Koblenz tourists & business travellers.\"\n\n\nThe modern apartment with a great design has been extensively renovated and awaits you with very high-quality furnishings. The apartment consists of a cozy living room, a separate bedroom, a large separate kitchen and a bathroom with WC. The bedroom has a large 180x200 king-size bed. The living room has a dining area with dining table for up to 3 people and a couch, sitting area with Smart TV incl. free Netflix account. The couch can be folded out as a sofa bed and offers space for one person with the modern folding function including slatted frame and mattress on an area of 120x200. The kitchen has everything you need for cooking: Stove, oven, microwave, refrigerator, freezer compartment, dishwasher and coffee machine as well as pots, pans and cutlery, of course. The bathroom has a shower & washing machine and dryer.\n\n\n","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"no"},"basement":{"value":"shared"},"bathroom":{"v